  "title": "flow (model document)",
  "description": "A walkthrough whose screens and edges are parameterised over `dimensions`. The FILE is two YAML documents separated by a line that is exactly `---`: this schema is the first (the model); the second (the views: `active`, `views[]`) is the Studio's own.",
